@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Opening : fresh START,\nclosed confirmed
Opening --> Settling : only open limit
Settling --> Watering : open held 2 s
Watering --> PumpStopping : 5 min elapsed
PumpStopping --> Closing : next scan\n(limits available)
Closing --> Idle : only close limit
Settling --> FeedbackFault : open feedback lost
Watering --> FeedbackFault : open feedback lost
PumpStopping --> FeedbackFault : open feedback lost
FeedbackFault --> Idle : START released,\nclosed confirmed
Interrupted --> Idle : START released,\nclosed confirmed

state Opening : valve_open_contactor ON
state Watering : pump_contactor ON
state Closing : valve_close_contactor ON
state FeedbackFault : all outputs OFF
state Interrupted : all outputs OFF

note as N
From Idle to Closing, checked first:
1. both limits true -> FeedbackFault
2. stop_ok or overload_ok lost -> Interrupted
Both fault states also wait until
permission returns and no conflict.
end note
@enduml
